        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Dreams Boundary》is a roguelike card game where you must construct your card deck at the start of each run before embarking on your adventure. The combat system consists of a Preparation Phase and an Action Phase. Cards you play do not take effect immediately, but generate intents similar to enemies. During the Action Phase, both you and enemies will execute prepared actions in sequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/aae12f178183d391bbd709e7a64943ef.avif?t=1760710398\" width=600 height=80 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Select the cards to play this turn and press the action button - the battle will commence immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/b6fea944125e44fbbd704a6e4408b767.poster.avif?t=1760710398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/b6fea944125e44fbbd704a6e4408b767.webm?t=1760710398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/19271702103f6f0699c0ff1995bf658c.avif?t=1760710398\" width=600 height=80 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Freely explore the map and visit locations of interest. Note: With limited movement chances, plan your route for maximum rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/aad999a45a6dd189c8a354410620e515.poster.avif?t=1760710398\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/aad999a45a6dd189c8a354410620e515.webm?t=1760710398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/aad999a45a6dd189c8a354410620e515.mp4?t=1760710398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/c9fc45bf28ab0d425d73342a4f776b4f.avif?t=1760710398\" width=600 height=80 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gain XP to level up. Each level-up lets you choose a talent to enhance your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/d0ec963a57aa10af60f95a9eac63ffd0.poster.avif?t=1760710398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/d0ec963a57aa10af60f95a9eac63ffd0.webm?t=1760710398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/62bd5275e546ef8352aa526b3682b450.avif?t=1760710398\" width=600 height=80 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect powerful relics to aid your journey. Gather specific quantities to activate ultimate effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/30afef28c38cb127389680d58c6df993.poster.avif?t=1760710398\" width=600 height=361 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/30afef28c38cb127389680d58c6df993.webm?t=1760710398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/e066d06996e32a1180eaaba2ccd93d9b.avif?t=1760710398\" width=600 height=80 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter random events and negotiate with shady merchants - but do you really need what they offer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/cff03a90f2a5fb681ca1e9461b2b5e1b.poster.avif?t=1760710398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/cff03a90f2a5fb681ca1e9461b2b5e1b.webm?t=1760710398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p>",
