m_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/30afef28c38cb127389680d58c6df993.webm?t=1760710398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/e066d06996e32a1180eaaba2ccd93d9b.avif?t=1760710398\" width=600 height=80 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter random events and negotiate with shady merchants - but do you really need what they offer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/cff03a90f2a5fb681ca1e9461b2b5e1b.poster.avif?t=1760710398\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541180/extras/cff03a90f2a5fb681ca1e9461b2b5e1b.webm?t=1760710398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p>",
